  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...11...14 spirit. When this spirit dies, all non-spirit allies within its range are healed for 1...6...7 Health for each second this spirit was alive. This spirit dies after 20 seconds.",
